# Everything in here is downloaded or produced by a run; only the scripts and
# SETUP.md are source. Sizes noted because a stray `git add .` would be costly.

# The runtime (pip install of vLLM + torch, ~15 GB)
venv/

# Model weights (~30.4 GB for Qwen3.8-27B-FP8, ~2.2 GB for the embedder)
weights/

# Job output: vllm.a40-l40.out, embed-server.log
*.out
*.log
